; =======================================================================
; Vole Machine Program: Bitwise AND & Screen Display
; Purpose: Load numbers (3A and C5), compute (3A AND C5),
;          and display the result (00) on the screen.
; =======================================================================
2000    ; Load immediate value 00 into Register 0 (clear reference)
213A    ; Load immediate value 3A into Register 1
22C5    ; Load immediate value C5 into Register 2
8312    ; Bitwise AND: R3 = R1 AND R2 (3A AND C5 = 00)
3300    ; Store contents of R3 into Main Memory location 00
33FF    ; Write contents of R3 to Screen output (Memory FF)
C000    ; Halt execution
